---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Me">

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-10 px-4">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">About Me</h1>

    <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Hi! I'm <span class="font-semibold">Thomas Gonzalez</span>, a Mechanical 
      Engineering student at Johns Hopkins University. I specialize in
      robotics, electromechanical systems, and medical device development.
      I love building systems that move, sense, solve problems, and help people.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      At Hopkins, I lead the Hopkinauts Mars Rover Arm Sub-Team, where I design, 
      build, and train autonomous robotic systems for the University Rover Challenge.
      I also contributed to the rover’s biological analysis components and helped
      raise support for the team.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Previously, I worked with researchers in biomedical engineering at George 
      Washington University to develop biodegradable sensors for heart transplant
      patients. I’ve also designed and analyzed mechanical systems, performed
      subsystem diagnostics, and built custom electromechanical devices.
    </p>
  </section>


  <!-- Skills Section -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-14 px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Skills & Tools</h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="badge badge-lg">CAD (Fusion 360 / SolidWorks)</div>
      <div class="badge badge-lg">ANSYS FEA</div>
      <div class="badge badge-lg">Robotics</div>
      <div class="badge badge-lg">Electronics</div>
      <div class="badge badge-lg">MATLAB / LabVIEW</div>
      <div class="badge badge-lg">Prototyping & Fabrication</div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
